WORK SESSIONS

This folder is where ecosystem-fred-tamlinux hands work between sessions.

  WHATNOW        what was just done and what comes next. Read it first.
  W<n>-<name>    one record per work session: what was asked, what got
                 done, what failed and what is left.
  history/       records written before the 2026-11-17 cutover, moved
                 from docs/ai/ under D278. Read-only and not indexed.

Public Tamlinux repositories have no docs/ai/ folder. Their old records
are in work/history/ and new sessions write work/W<n>-<name> records.
